 {"key": "5b03a85a-0d23-44a4-b9b5-647d6e65d86f|title", "text": "let's, gimme that, y'all"}, {"key": "1015f614-a8a6-4634-97e1-86252ed3b149|title", "text": "Sproščene številke v hitrem govoru"}, {"key": "69aea060-6196-4732-a658-25a6b0d08e52|title", "text": "Besede, ki v sproščenem govoru izgubijo en zlog"}, {"key": "d19575cd-6d8a-4493-b1e0-f3d272543988|title", "text": "I'ma in druge ultra-sproščene oblike"}, {"key": "551b9527-f712-421d-966c-24644f360746|title", "text": "Več redukcij v sproščenih pozdravih"}, {"key": "b855faed-9428-4a1b-b95c-1e0c3b2d30c8|title", "text": "oughta, don't hafta, wantcha"}, {"key": "a988c705-5d07-4e9a-a930-5967242b673b|title", "text": "Slavna skrajna redukcija: 'Did you eat yet?'"}, {"key": "e363cee4-e7a6-4107-9da8-a4a5ac3c4a47|title", "text": "'because of' in 'sort of a'"}, {"key": "d885413e-df2d-4088-b5a9-f07b62449289|title", "text": "Sproščeno da/ne: yep, nope, uh-huh"}, {"key": "d0dc977b-e24c-46c3-a2a1-6a98544f014f|title", "text": "'want a' (stvar) proti 'want to' (dejanje)"}, {"key": "6c1b9c14-fcf8-463c-9ba2-34b43d55e77f|title", "text": "wouldn't have → wouldn'ta"}, {"key": "2856e155-9edf-4a4e-9b05-c66ea6dac7d1|title", "text": "just 'cause, gonna need"}, {"key": "233cf355-0eca-4443-9a49-65fb7f9946ac|title", "text": "ain't — am not, is not, are not"}, {"key": "dc20f314-54fe-4dbd-a7f9-1b8af815d3af|title", "text": "gotcha — got you"}, {"key": "83e44703-96d2-48c4-8303-0bc0b0bbb6ed|title", "text": "musta, mighta — must have, might have"}, {"key": "ae8c9220-fd86-4c54-a3d7-97ceb131af9a|title", "text": "shouldn'ta, couldn'ta — nikalni pretekli modalni glagoli"}, {"key": "7c1b096d-60ed-4c34-b500-ab3afab592fa|title", "text": "Izpuščanje g: doin', goin', talkin'"}, {"key": "0269fc6d-11c6-4667-9e5f-34ff1033bcf6|title", "text": "somethin', nothin', anythin'"}, {"key": "cd64bb2e-37b3-4869-94d3-830cbdf2eb6a|title", "text": "'em — them"}, {"key": "66b204c8-d0cb-4469-a82c-7416aa6f96b6|title", "text": "'n' — and"}, {"key": "74f83968-80ee-48d6-8255-ecd4e